"P1796838375" "The Talons of Vengeance are eternal! We shall not stop in our pursuit of oathbreakers, and injustice!"
// Script Variable ElderVar :
"P3564493076" "Cimerora was supposed to bring peace to this world. Look at how far it has fallen!"
