// 5 Actor1 :
"P1847473616" "<t=5 d=5>I believed we would meet under much different circumstances... but I suppose we don't get to choose where destiny leads us."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P3657358938" "<t=5 d=5>This current threat we face could spell the end of humanity, before the supposed 'Coming Storm' even arrives."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P3615976821" "<t=5 d=5>So, without further pause, allow me to introduce myself, properly..."
// 5 Actor1 :
"P1567401588" "<t=5 d=5>I am the Dream Doctor, the letter writer. You and I, {HeroName}, have a lot of work to do."
