// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Solaris 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page FirstTalk Text :
"P2766365960" "{HeroName}, I will take the <color red>DiE DIe dIE</color> idol, for the moment. We will have to enact our plan, and fast.<br><br>We will have <color red>reMeMBER yOU</color> a fleet set sail with Marcus Valerius at the helm to sent the idol into the <color yellow>Abyss at the end <color red>wiLL reTURn</color> of the world</color>.<br><br>Marcus Valerius is one of the <color red>deSTrOY you</color> champions of Cimerora and has the willpower to resist whatever is inside of this idol.<br><br>You must rescue Marcus, then help save Cimerora from <color red>NeVER eND</color> the Talons of Vengeance!<br><br><color orange>You hand the idol over to Sister Solaris. Mot's whisperings cease.</color> "
// Answer Text :
"P867194427" "Take me to Cimerora."
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Solaris1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P320159862" "<color deepskyblue>What Was Built Upon the Past</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Part Three: At All Costs</color><br><br>{HeroName}, we have more problems. Daedalus helped guide Marcus Valerius and the small fleet of ships out to sea. I've been tracking the progress but have had a terrible vision.<br><br>The Talons of Vengeance commanded some sort of monstrosity that dwells beneath the sea to destroy Marcus and the ships. As we speak, they are attacking whatever is left of them!<br><br>We cannot allow the Talons to get their hands on that idol, {HeroName}. Please, you must set sail and save Marcus from whatever monster is attacking those ships!"
// Answer Text :
"P4086069132" "I'll handle it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Solaris2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P1002644119" "<color deepskyblue>What Was Built Upon the Past</color><br><br><color deepskyblue>Finale: The Rise and Fall of Romulus Augustus</color><br><br>Marcus is tending to his wounds now, though he insists on holding the idol to protect anyone else from it.<br><br>Marathon is doing his best to create a vessel suitable for the open seas, but we have more problems, {HeroName}.<br><br> We have reports from our scouts that the Talons of Vengeance have been building up an army with the mortal enemy of Cimerora, <color red>Romulus Augustus</color>. They gather in Vespillo Pass now, waiting to destroy all of Cimerora. Romulus has finally gone mad, perhaps from the dark energies that now control him.<br><br>Cimerora is weakened now, {HeroName}. We have no army to send against these monsters. We only have one option, which is for those of us that remain to fight against the army. Myself, Imperious, Daedalus, Sister Airlia, and another strange man from the future, are ready to go on your word."
// Answer Text :
"P1919903555" "Let's go."
// Answer Text :
"P1222941934" "No, you all stay behind, guard the town. I will handle the army alone."
// Page Alone Text :
"P509858194" "What? {HeroName}, are you certain? Just yourself against an army?<br><br><color orange>The mission will be incredibly difficult to run alone by most characters. If you choose to do so, good luck!</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P4111404024" "I am sure, I will go it alone."
// Answer Text :
"P1729777236" "On second thought, come with me. We will fight them together."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2090049448" "We will hold a gathering on top of the <color red>haTE</color> Sybil temple, {HeroName}, to decide what <color red>hoPElESS</color> to do about this idol.<br><br>Imperious, Daedalus, myself, and, unfortunately, Sister Airlia, shall be <color red>desTRUCTiON</color> in attendence. Imperious seems to believe she will be able to help us in every situation, but I have my doubts.<br><br>Would you mind holding onto the idol for a little longer?"
// AcceptString :
"P2963177868" "I can handle it."
// SendOffString :
"P597069212" "Excellent. There will be, once more, a boat waiting to take you to the temple. I <color red>nO</color> will be waiting with others <color red>oNE</color> for your arrival.<br><br>I would come <color red>loVES</color> prepared though, {HeroName}, we do not <color red>YoU</color> know what could happen in these troubling times."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P106494773" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: Harbingers</color>"

