"P4252183241" "You arrive <color red>YoUR deaTH</color> at the Sybil <color red>iS inevITabLE</color> temple. You can overhear the discussions already happening up above."
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3583408089" "Meet with the Cimerorans"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P1147989305" "Fend off the Talons of Vengeance"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P1953961176" "Speak with Sister Solaris to get to Cimerora"
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P4159770005" "Save Marcus Valerius"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1039114360" "Imperious"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2347943247" "{HeroName}, thank you for arriving. Sister Solaris tells us you are in the possession of an extremely evil being."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3349913484" "As you have told me before, Airlia, the gods have abandoned Cimerora. We are on our own to destroy this."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P1392881148" "I shall do it, to protect our lands -"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P4179134901" "We will never give such a dangerous creature to you monsters!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P2682415197" "{HeroName}... you must finish this!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2592474696" "Sister Solaris"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P740422761" "If something is not done, it will bring about the destruction of all mankind."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2033399267" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Cimerorans, we will be taking the god of death that you possess."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2769063883" "That voice... it's a Keres! The Talons of Vengeance!"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P1979557055" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>The Furies have watched Cimerora grow more and more corrupted by outside forces."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P2959484454" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Cimerora will be destroyed. Hand over the god of death and we may show mercy in these last moments."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P3402742436" "<t=5 caption x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=5><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor black>Then your fates have been sealed!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P628402909" "My abilities have been taxed...!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4189828794" "Sister Airlia"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P1306590929" "I have seen the monster in my dreams. It is a god of death, impossible for anything short of a god to destroy."
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P1244503692" "If you go, Imperious, who will protect us from what remains of Romulus Augustus?"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P418126982" "Urgh... I cannot help any further, Imperious!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P723300503" "Daedalus"
// BEHAVIORLIST :
"P4264244075" "It is a dangerous proposal... But we could sail the item to the end of the world, to the Abyss, and cast out the creature there."
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P4222613163" "I cannot help any further... I am sorry...!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2509602624" "<shout>Your time has come to an end, Cimerorans!"

